    <data key="d0">Spot.io Cloud Architecture on AWS</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A4Lfk1Zz1dE</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture illustrating how Spot.io collects infrastructure metrics, predicts spot interruptions using SageMaker, and automatically manages spot instances in customer environments.</data>
